WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.236
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:04.637
We hope you're all
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.405
And, now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.405 --> 00:00:07.873
President Biden today
traveled to New York.

00:00:07.873 --> 00:00:10.710
Said New Yorkers,
"Oh, my God! Move!"

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.013
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:16.882
In a new interview, Florida
Governor Ron DeSantis said

00:00:16.882 --> 00:00:19.452
that the media's coverage
of Hurricane Ian was motivated

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:22.988
by a political agenda, adding,
"I mean, as soon as it was over

00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:25.792
there was a rainbow
outside my window."

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:27.594
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:31.096
[Mockingly]
"That's not political? Okay."

00:00:31.096 --> 00:00:33.800
Georgia Senate candidate
Herschel Walker's campaign

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.902
has announced that since he
was accused earlier this week

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:38.404
of paying for
his ex-girlfriend's abortion,

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:40.673
it has raised
more than $500,000.

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:42.208
In fact, it's going so well,

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:45.812
Walker's thinking about asking
all his exes to come forward.

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:48.214
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.917
FEMA announced yesterday that
phone operators from the IRS

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:52.651
have been brought in
to help the agency

00:00:52.651 --> 00:00:55.054
handle the volume of calls
after Hurricane Ian.

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:59.158
So now getting help will be just
as easy as doing your taxes.

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:00.960
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.030
Tomorrow is Russian President
Vladimir Putin's 70th birthday,

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:05.865
where he will blow out
the candles

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:07.901
and then push the cake
off a balcony.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:11.137
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:13.606
Former President Trump
said in a speech yesterday

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:15.875
that he is being targeted
by the FBI because,

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.376
"They want to silence me."

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:21.080
Hey, it's not their fault the
only way to truly silence Trump

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:23.616
is to sit him down
for a deposition.

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:24.950
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:27.052
A new list
from "Fortune" magazine

00:01:27.052 --> 00:01:30.089
has ranked CVS Health
President and CEO Karen Lynch

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:32.024
as the most powerful woman
in business --

00:01:32.024 --> 00:01:35.328
because she's the only one
with the key to the razors.

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:37.497
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:41.634
That's -- That's power.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:44.904
A 17-foot-tall statue
was recently unveiled in Canada

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:47.673
of a giant hand holding a Cheeto

00:01:47.673 --> 00:01:50.543
with orange dust
on the fingertips.

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:53.780
So the other statue
obviously looked like this.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.282
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.484 --> 00:02:00.553
Two right hands.

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:02.288
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:04.624
It's a statue
with two right hands.

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:06.259
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:11.231
The world's oldest living dog,
Pebbles, died recently

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:13.165
at 22 years old and 50 days.

00:02:13.165 --> 00:02:14.867
"You son of a bitch!"

00:02:14.867 --> 00:02:17.337
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.173 --> 00:02:22.908
It's a bummer I went
into that joke

00:02:22.908 --> 00:02:25.177
laughing about
the weed fingertip statue.

00:02:25.177 --> 00:02:28.381
I'm like -- "Ha ha ha ha!
The world's oldest dog died."

00:02:31.517 --> 00:02:33.886
Wyoming Congresswoman Liz Cheney
spoke last night

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:36.656
at an event
at Arizona State University,

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:39.792
and because it was ASU,
she made sure to speak slowly.

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:41.861
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:43.830
Alright, we have an issue here,
I want to admit.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.732
Our head writer, Alex Baze,
went to University of Arizona,

00:02:46.732 --> 00:02:48.668
and so he oftentimes
will write jokes

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:50.703
that are very unkind
to Arizona State University.

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:53.539
So I'd like to apologize to
anyone who went to that school,

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:56.508
who's currently going to that
school, and let's move on.

00:02:56.508 --> 00:02:58.110
Um...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.613
Wyoming Congresswoman Liz Cheney
spoke last night

00:03:00.613 --> 00:03:02.314
at an event
at Arizona State University,

00:03:02.314 --> 00:03:04.450
though I'm not sure why
they needed a congresswoman

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.953
to read off the beer-pong rules!

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:08.888
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:14.293
Oh, my God.

00:03:14.293 --> 00:03:16.529
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.498 --> 00:03:22.068
I mean, University of Arizona
is not Harvard, dude.

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:24.437
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:27.139
Alright, so, we asked another
writer to cover this story,

00:03:27.139 --> 00:03:29.675
because obviously Baze
cannot get above himself here

00:03:29.675 --> 00:03:31.978
to do this.
And finally Mike Scollins --

00:03:31.978 --> 00:03:33.846
Our good friend Mike Scollins
chipped in here.

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:36.115
And finally
Wyoming Congresswoman Liz Cheney

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:38.617
spoke last night at an event
at Arizona State University.

00:03:38.617 --> 00:03:40.153
Well, at least everyone there

00:03:40.153 --> 00:03:41.821
is used to not getting
their first choice.

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:43.289
You guys!

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:44.823
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.823 --> 00:03:47.593
Come on!

00:03:47.593 --> 00:03:49.429
That was a monologue, everybody.

